1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,046
Retro_Ekipa Presents:

2
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:18,970
Sync and correction: FSFinker

3
00:00:55,227 --> 00:00:57,319
Whoever gets to the temple first, wins.

4
00:00:57,319 --> 00:00:59,907
What? Hey! No fair!

5
00:01:01,436 --> 00:01:02,929
Let's get him!

6
00:01:12,490 --> 00:01:14,081
- Hi Nima.
- Good morning, Aang

7
00:01:14,204 --> 00:01:16,163
Hey, Menmen

8
00:01:22,126 --> 00:01:24,045
Oh, perfect timing.

9
00:01:25,085 --> 00:01:26,391
Would you mind giving me a lift?

10
00:01:26,391 --> 00:01:28,055
Giatzo! This isn't the best time.

11
00:01:28,342 --> 00:01:30,215
I'm getting old, you know.

12
00:01:30,215 --> 00:01:32,514
My body doesn't move like it used to.

13
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:34,632
I'm kind of in the middle of something.

14
00:01:34,845 --> 00:01:35,972
You are so heavy!

15
00:01:35,972 --> 00:01:37,222
Heavy?! Me?!

16
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:39,300
I eat nothing but vegetables.

17
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:41,300
Pie is not a vegetable.

18
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:42,610
I'm gonna lose the race!

19
00:01:42,936 --> 00:01:45,300
Race? What race?

20
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:47,300
Finally, we won! We won!

21
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:55,300
Aang.

22
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:59,300
As an airbender, it's important that you know when to show restraint,

23
00:02:00,129 --> 00:02:02,501
Even if you have a power to win.

24
00:02:02,954 --> 00:02:04,833
You are the Avatar.

25
00:02:05,300 --> 00:02:09,300
A lot of people are going to rely on you.

26
00:02:18,857 --> 00:02:22,483
- Where is the Avatar?
- He's gone! He ran away!

27
00:02:22,483 --> 00:02:23,849
What? I'm here!

28
00:02:23,990 --> 00:02:26,202
Where is the Avatar?

29
00:02:27,403 --> 00:02:30,069
Aang! Where are you?

30
00:02:30,069 --> 00:02:31,780
Giatzo! I'm here!

31
00:02:37,300 --> 00:02:44,300
I'm here.

32
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:47,975
Hey, Momo.

33
00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:50,173
Hi, Appa.

34
00:02:50,300 --> 00:02:51,300
Was I asleep for long?

35
00:02:51,300 --> 00:02:53,300
Oh, okay, okay.

36
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:54,300
I'm awake already.

37
00:02:54,300 --> 00:02:55,300
I know, I know.

38
00:02:55,300 --> 00:02:57,300
We've got a job to finish.

39
00:02:58,258 --> 00:03:00,300
Let's continue our journey.

40
00:03:00,300 --> 00:03:02,300
Back to our old home.

41
00:03:49,515 --> 00:03:51,569
This may not have been our best trip,

42
00:03:51,569 --> 00:03:54,359
but any air bender relic we find makes it all worthwhile.

43
00:04:00,290 --> 00:04:03,290
This could be the oldest piece in our collection.

44
00:04:08,290 --> 00:04:09,290
Sonam...

45
00:04:22,336 --> 00:04:24,117
I miss you.

46
00:04:29,853 --> 00:04:32,398
Momo, go outside with Appa.

47
00:04:33,996 --> 00:04:34,903
Now!

48
00:04:43,908 --> 00:04:45,298
Who are you?

49
00:04:45,305 --> 00:04:46,628
Why are you doing this?

50
00:04:51,499 --> 00:04:53,078
I don't want to hurt you.

51
00:04:56,861 --> 00:04:59,495
Where is it? Where is it? No, that's not it.

52
00:04:59,549 --> 00:05:01,314
Hey! Those are antics!

53
00:05:13,104 --> 00:05:14,038
Enough!

54
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:19,418
Wait! I found it!

55
00:05:21,604 --> 00:05:23,726
Sonam? Why they want you?

56
00:05:42,588 --> 00:05:43,485
Wait!

57
00:05:46,679 --> 00:05:49,015
No! That's a thousand years old!

58
00:05:53,927 --> 00:05:54,899
Give it to me!

59
00:05:54,899 --> 00:05:55,985
Why don't we just talk

60
00:05:56,113 --> 00:05:56,900
Maybe I can help?

61
00:05:56,981 --> 00:05:58,983
We don't need your help, Avatar!

62
00:05:59,651 --> 00:06:03,408
We're done living in a world where benders have all the power and we have none!

63
00:06:03,577 --> 00:06:04,702
Who are you?

64
00:06:04,702 --> 00:06:05,896
We're the Denied!

65
00:06:05,896 --> 00:06:06,950
The Denied?

66
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:08,455
Just kill him already!

67
00:06:08,455 --> 00:06:10,497
No! You'll bring the whole place down!

68
00:06:37,234 --> 00:06:39,238
You... saved me...

69
00:06:41,275 --> 00:06:43,623
Kalik! Grab the map! Let's go!

70
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:59,015
I'm fine, Momo. I'm fine.

71
00:08:01,277 --> 00:08:03,321
We've got to get to Republic City.

72
00:08:04,358 --> 00:08:06,334
Appa! Yip, yip!

73
00:08:23,336 --> 00:08:24,597
Water

74
00:08:25,178 --> 00:08:27,608
Her tribes gather strength from the Moon.

75
00:08:29,175 --> 00:08:31,358
And flow with the tides.

76
00:08:32,220 --> 00:08:33,182
Earth

77
00:08:33,846 --> 00:08:36,347
A kingdom of unshakeable will

78
00:08:36,347 --> 00:08:39,193
Reliable and strong

79
00:08:42,396 --> 00:08:43,159
Fire

80
00:08:44,458 --> 00:08:46,988
A nation capable of great destruction.

81
00:08:48,069 --> 00:08:49,168
But also...

82
00:08:50,113 --> 00:08:52,034
... of great warmth.

83
00:08:53,783 --> 00:08:54,584
Air

84
00:08:54,992 --> 00:08:58,124
Peaceful nomads, with the power of the huricane.

85
00:08:58,451 --> 00:09:01,275
And the spirit of a gentle breeze.

86
00:09:02,959 --> 00:09:04,509
For generations

87
00:09:04,509 --> 00:09:05,800
The Avatar

88
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:08,933
The one master of all four elements

89
00:09:08,933 --> 00:09:10,846
Kept the nations in balance.

90
00:09:12,522 --> 00:09:14,819
But when that responsibility fell to me

91
00:09:14,920 --> 00:09:16,920
As a child, I ran away.

92
00:09:17,098 --> 00:09:19,696
I was caught in a deadly storm,

93
00:09:19,696 --> 00:09:23,316
but my Avatar Spirit preserved me in a sphere of energy

94
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:27,528
where I stayed for a hundred years.

95
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:31,278
I woke to discover that the balance preserved by the Avatar

96
00:09:31,278 --> 00:09:33,578
had been destroyed by war.

97
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:37,680
The air nomads were gone.

98
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:39,680
All but one.

99
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:40,680
Me.

100
00:09:41,180 --> 00:09:45,180
I can no longer run from my responsibility as the Avatar.

101
00:09:45,180 --> 00:09:51,180
I found allies from every nation, benders, and non-benders.

102
00:09:52,633 --> 00:09:55,180
Katara taught me how to waterbend.

103
00:09:55,180 --> 00:09:59,180
Toph trained me in the ways of the earth benders

104
00:09:59,180 --> 00:10:04,180
Zuko, once my worst enemy, became my fire-bending teacher.

105
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:09,600
Soka showed me that bravery is the most important part of being a leader.

106
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:12,221
We became a family

107
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:16,325
and together we ended the hundred year war.

108
00:10:17,617 --> 00:10:22,600
Then we began the hard work of rebuilding the world.

109
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:38,080
for so long the nations stood apart alone.

110
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:40,480
And we all suffered as a result.

111
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:43,320
But here on this ancient site,

112
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:46,320
we created a place where all people are welcome,

113
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:48,800
bender and non-bender alike.

114
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:52,800
Working together in peace to build the future.

115
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:56,200
Thou there are still those who would seek to divide us,

116
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:58,440
we remain united.

117
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:00,240
As a council representative,

118
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:02,116
I am honored to be here today

119
00:11:02,146 --> 00:11:05,211
celebrating the Anniversary of Republic City,

120
00:11:05,211 --> 00:11:09,803
and the opening of Unity Tower, a symbol for all people.

121
00:11:32,125 --> 00:11:33,378
Momo!

122
00:11:35,403 --> 00:11:36,883
Appa!

123
00:11:37,125 --> 00:11:39,261
I missed you too, old friend.

124
00:11:41,373 --> 00:11:43,250
- Aang!
- Katara!

125
00:11:48,379 --> 00:11:49,600
You're hurt!

126
00:11:57,632 --> 00:11:59,266
Take a deep breath.

127
00:12:01,053 --> 00:12:03,600
And exhale.

128
00:12:05,016 --> 00:12:07,110
I've heard the Denied are growing in numbers,

129
00:12:07,110 --> 00:12:09,183
but they've never done anything like this.

130
00:12:09,322 --> 00:12:10,980
Attacking the Avatar?

131
00:12:11,022 --> 00:12:15,820
Yeah. They were incredible fighters, even without bending.

132
00:12:16,820 --> 00:12:18,020
Oh!

133
00:12:18,020 --> 00:12:20,020
Breath through it.

134
00:12:20,020 --> 00:12:22,420
Be honest, you're enjoying this.

135
00:12:22,420 --> 00:12:24,420
Hey, this is serious.

136
00:12:24,420 --> 00:12:26,420
Whatever this map they took was,

137
00:12:26,420 --> 00:12:29,420
if they were willing to kill the avatar to get it,

138
00:12:29,420 --> 00:12:31,420
what else are they willing to do?

139
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:32,420
I don't know.

140
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:35,420
I'm worried about you.

141
00:12:35,420 --> 00:12:39,420
You're spending more and more time at the air temple, alone.

142
00:12:40,926 --> 00:12:44,230
It's... how I hold on to my past.

143
00:12:45,830 --> 00:12:47,830
I know how hard this is for you.

144
00:12:52,230 --> 00:12:53,675
When I was attacked,

145
00:12:54,482 --> 00:12:58,247
all I could think about was that this could be it.

146
00:13:00,630 --> 00:13:02,630
I'm the last airbender.

147
00:13:04,550 --> 00:13:08,230
If I die, my culture dies with me.

148
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:15,360
You may be the last airbender, but you're not alone.

149
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:20,360
Aang, none of this would exist without you.

150
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:25,360
You made the city possible with your heart and your mind.

151
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:31,360
Because of you, all of the nations live here together.

152
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:35,360
All except mine.

153
00:13:45,366 --> 00:13:46,503
I know

154
00:13:46,700 --> 00:13:49,493
But the people here still need your protection.

155
00:13:50,037 --> 00:13:54,630
you're an air bender, but you're also the Avatar.

156
00:13:56,870 --> 00:13:57,870
You're right.

157
00:13:59,380 --> 00:14:03,262
Whoever this Sonam person is, I need to find out more.

158
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:31,761
- Aang.
- Avatar Roku.

159
00:14:31,761 --> 00:14:34,143
It is good to see you again.

160
00:14:34,143 --> 00:14:35,624
How can I help you?

161
00:14:35,624 --> 00:14:39,920
In your lifetime, did you ever hear of an ancient air bender named Sonam?

162
00:14:39,988 --> 00:14:45,020
I have not, but you have many past lives to call upon.

163
00:14:45,020 --> 00:14:49,020
Perhaps one further back in the Avatar cycle can help you.

164
00:14:49,020 --> 00:14:51,020
Thank you, Avatar Roku

165
00:14:53,550 --> 00:14:55,550
- I'm sorry.
- I have never heard of him.

166
00:14:56,187 --> 00:14:58,958
- Perhaps someone else
- Not here

167
00:15:09,867 --> 00:15:11,660
Hello?

168
00:15:11,660 --> 00:15:13,788
Is there anyone here?

169
00:15:14,455 --> 00:15:15,666
Hello?

170
00:15:17,583 --> 00:15:23,469
Who calls upon Avatar Sion's vast wealth of knowledge?

171
00:15:26,759 --> 00:15:28,520
Oh! Hello!

172
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:32,112
You look like the Avatar from a time quite distant from mine.

173
00:15:32,112 --> 00:15:35,112
Please, please, tell me about your era!

174
00:15:35,112 --> 00:15:36,684
What are people wearing?

175
00:15:36,684 --> 00:15:38,445
Are sandals still a thing?

176
00:15:38,445 --> 00:15:39,746
Uhh... Yes?

177
00:15:39,746 --> 00:15:43,405
Oh, why? Why, after so many years,

178
00:15:43,405 --> 00:15:47,846
Open toes, seeing someone else's crusty cuticles.

179
00:15:47,846 --> 00:15:49,240
Disgusting!

180
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:50,282
Right...

181
00:15:50,350 --> 00:15:52,451
Anyway, I have come for your guidance.

182
00:15:52,535 --> 00:15:54,119
You see, I was attacked.

183
00:15:54,190 --> 00:15:55,710
It was not me, okay?

184
00:15:55,710 --> 00:15:56,550
Wasn't me.

185
00:15:56,550 --> 00:15:57,550
I know that.

186
00:15:57,550 --> 00:16:00,910
I think it might have something to do with an air bender named Sonam.

187
00:16:00,910 --> 00:16:01,750
Hmm.

188
00:16:01,750 --> 00:16:02,750
Sonam.

189
00:16:02,750 --> 00:16:04,550
It sounds familiar.

190
00:16:04,550 --> 00:16:05,550
Sonam.

191
00:16:05,550 --> 00:16:07,550
Where have I heard that name before?

192
00:16:08,259 --> 00:16:09,885
Sonam was the youngest daughter

193
00:16:09,885 --> 00:16:12,469
of the owner of the possum-chicken shop at the corner of the marketplace.

194
00:16:12,620 --> 00:16:14,286
Wait, that was my ex.

195
00:16:14,286 --> 00:16:15,438
Someiong.

196
00:16:15,438 --> 00:16:18,725
If only she didn't have those humongous toenails.

197
00:16:19,186 --> 00:16:20,271
Disgusting.

198
00:16:20,312 --> 00:16:21,443
This is going nowhere.

199
00:16:21,443 --> 00:16:23,066
Sonem? Sonum?

200
00:16:23,620 --> 00:16:25,781
Well, thank you for your time.

201
00:16:25,781 --> 00:16:27,570
I must continue my search.

202
00:16:27,620 --> 00:16:29,620
Oh, Sonam!

203
00:16:29,620 --> 00:16:33,620
You're asking about the legend of the Lost Avatar.

204
00:16:34,368 --> 00:16:37,620
- Sonam was an Avatar?
- Indeed she was.

205
00:16:37,955 --> 00:16:42,466
She was the avatar in the golden age of air benders.

206
00:16:42,620 --> 00:16:48,620
Legend said she had a staff that could channel the vast energy of the Spirit World.

207
00:16:48,620 --> 00:16:51,620
Granting its keeper unlimited power.

208
00:16:51,620 --> 00:16:54,620
Is... is that even possible?

209
00:16:54,638 --> 00:16:56,620
Ehh. We'll never know for sure.

210
00:16:56,974 --> 00:17:00,620
Many avatars have tried to communicate with her, but they couldn't.

211
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:02,620
She disappeared so completely.

212
00:17:02,620 --> 00:17:06,020
That it was as if she never existed.

213
00:17:06,020 --> 00:17:08,460
And perhaps it's better that way.

214
00:17:08,460 --> 00:17:13,060
Maybe such a staff was too dangerous for anyone to possess,

215
00:17:13,060 --> 00:17:15,100
even the Avatar.

216
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:17,540
But that's exactly why I need to find it.

217
00:17:17,540 --> 00:17:20,140
The people who attacked me discovered a map,

218
00:17:20,140 --> 00:17:22,300
it must lead to the staff.

219
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:26,380
Avatar Sion, please, you have to tell me where it is.

220
00:17:29,020 --> 00:17:31,860
The legend says that Sonam disappeared

221
00:17:31,860 --> 00:17:36,860
with her staff on the peak of Mount Bai-hu

222
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:42,860
Katara, I'm sorry to leave so suddenly, but I found out what the Denied are after.

223
00:17:42,860 --> 00:17:45,785
Sonam and the staff of immense power

224
00:17:45,898 --> 00:17:48,785
And in their hands, it could be a devastating weapon.

225
00:17:49,860 --> 00:17:53,860
They have a head start. There's no time to waste.

226
00:17:54,156 --> 00:17:57,202
You take Appa and Momo, and gather up the rest of the team.

227
00:17:57,417 --> 00:17:59,119
We're gonna need some help

228
00:18:05,709 --> 00:18:07,045
Next on the agenda:

229
00:18:07,045 --> 00:18:09,525
A fire nation naval vessel came into conflict

230
00:18:09,525 --> 00:18:12,418
with an extremist group of non-benders called the Denied.

231
00:18:12,418 --> 00:18:14,259
They've been robbing ancient sites.

232
00:18:14,259 --> 00:18:15,511
Your majesty!

233
00:18:15,511 --> 00:18:18,055
An urgent message has arrived from Republic City.

234
00:18:18,055 --> 00:18:19,473
How impudent!

235
00:18:19,473 --> 00:18:20,974
Can't you see that Firelord Zuko is...

236
00:18:20,974 --> 00:18:21,770
Chamberlain!

237
00:18:23,227 --> 00:18:25,108
There is only one person who can send a message

238
00:18:25,108 --> 00:18:27,272
urgent enough to interrupt the Firelord's council.

239
00:18:27,569 --> 00:18:28,800
Is it from the avatar?

240
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:29,800
Yes, my lord.

241
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:30,800
Read it to me.

242
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:31,800
Yes, my lord.

243
00:18:36,412 --> 00:18:37,390
What are you doing?

244
00:18:37,434 --> 00:18:38,477
Read it quickly.

245
00:18:38,605 --> 00:18:40,800
Yes, Grand Chamberlain.

246
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:44,800
Flame your heart man, how's ruling the fire nation?

247
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:49,424
I hope the boring Chamberlain you mentioned in your letters

248
00:18:49,424 --> 00:18:51,505
isn't still annoying you.

249
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:54,800
Anywho, to cut to the chase, I need your help.

250
00:18:55,650 --> 00:18:57,290
Can you please come immediately.

251
00:18:57,290 --> 00:19:00,890
Oh, and don't forget to bring some firecracker buns.

252
00:19:03,370 --> 00:19:05,010
Allow me to present.

253
00:19:05,010 --> 00:19:06,210
Soka-cycle.

254
00:19:06,210 --> 00:19:10,570
Flames launch you into the sky where you can drop water bombs on your enemies.

255
00:19:10,570 --> 00:19:13,450
Then skiis pop out to help you stick the landing.

256
00:19:13,450 --> 00:19:14,930
Pretty great, right?

257
00:19:14,930 --> 00:19:16,130
Eh. boring.

258
00:19:16,130 --> 00:19:18,449
Why would you need a sled when you can just water-bend?

259
00:19:18,450 --> 00:19:19,970
Oh, let me, let me.

260
00:19:21,250 --> 00:19:24,610
Keep in mind there is plenty of folks like me who can't bend.

261
00:19:24,670 --> 00:19:27,670
Why would Avatar Aang partner with a non-bender

262
00:19:27,670 --> 00:19:28,670
Why?

263
00:19:28,670 --> 00:19:29,670
I'll tell you why.

264
00:19:29,670 --> 00:19:31,670
I'm saved him from the iceberg.

265
00:19:31,670 --> 00:19:35,670
My boomerang flew by his side while took care of our enemies with my trusty blade.

266
00:19:35,670 --> 00:19:39,670
I even took down the whole fire nation airship armada.

267
00:19:40,684 --> 00:19:41,670
And on top of all that

268
00:19:41,670 --> 00:19:44,670
I was more popular than him.

269
00:19:44,670 --> 00:19:47,670
You're such a liar, Soka.

270
00:19:49,670 --> 00:19:50,670
It's from the avatar.

271
00:19:50,670 --> 00:19:51,670
Wow!

272
00:19:51,670 --> 00:19:52,670
Really?

273
00:19:53,250 --> 00:19:55,250
Oh, so now you think I'm cool?

274
00:19:56,250 --> 00:20:00,356
Alright, metal benders, let's see if any of you tenderfoots

275
00:20:00,356 --> 00:20:01,909
can at least make me use my hands.

276
00:20:35,317 --> 00:20:39,322
I'm still the greatest earth bender in the world!

277
00:20:39,322 --> 00:20:40,714
And I'm bored

278
00:20:40,614 --> 00:20:44,621
- Master Toph, there's a bird on your head.
- And?

279
00:20:44,621 --> 00:20:45,922
It looks like it has a message.

280
00:20:46,245 --> 00:20:46,829
Read.

281
00:20:47,874 --> 00:20:50,833
It's from Avatar Aang, he needs your help. It's...

282
00:20:50,833 --> 00:20:51,917
the Denied?

283
00:20:52,042 --> 00:20:53,085
Where is he?

284
00:20:53,420 --> 00:20:54,420
Mount Bai-hu.

285
00:21:56,546 --> 00:21:58,809
No, no, no!...

286
00:22:03,530 --> 00:22:05,449
I loved that hat.

287
00:23:49,636 --> 00:23:51,035
Sonam?

288
00:23:55,976 --> 00:23:57,489
Could that be you?

289
00:25:01,040 --> 00:25:03,040
Who are you?

290
00:27:54,464 --> 00:27:55,632
Aang!

291
00:28:23,493 --> 00:28:25,911
Team Avatar to the rescue!

292
00:28:27,330 --> 00:28:28,264
Aang!

293
00:28:29,249 --> 00:28:30,102
You made it!

294
00:28:30,102 --> 00:28:33,337
You couldn't wait a day before running of to get yourself killed?

295
00:28:33,510 --> 00:28:35,510
I thought you were here looking for a staff.

296
00:28:35,510 --> 00:28:37,510
Who's this guy?

297
00:28:44,139 --> 00:28:45,510
An air bender.

298
00:29:06,036 --> 00:29:08,970
How did he hold up an entire mountain?

299
00:29:08,970 --> 00:29:11,970
His Chi is strong, like nothing I've ever felt.

300
00:29:13,460 --> 00:29:14,502
Hey, Avatar.

301
00:29:14,542 --> 00:29:17,970
You think there's gonna to be a record for longest frozen airbender?

302
00:29:17,970 --> 00:29:18,970
Yeah.

303
00:29:18,970 --> 00:29:20,970
How long do you think he was in that ice?

304
00:29:20,970 --> 00:29:21,970
I don't know.

305
00:29:23,053 --> 00:29:25,481
His tatoos look... ancient.

306
00:29:25,513 --> 00:29:27,824
He's been in there a long time.

307
00:29:28,100 --> 00:29:29,770
He smells good for an old guy.

308
00:29:29,770 --> 00:29:30,233
Yww

309
00:29:30,293 --> 00:29:32,699
What? My senses tell me this guy is pretty attractive.

310
00:29:32,976 --> 00:29:33,970
Someone else confirm.

311
00:29:33,970 --> 00:29:34,564
Toph! This is serious.

312
00:29:34,580 --> 00:29:36,000
What does attractive even mean?

313
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:37,580
Just give me a straight confirmation.

314
00:29:37,580 --> 00:29:38,580
Is he attractive?

315
00:29:38,580 --> 00:29:39,580
He's very attractive.

316
00:29:41,580 --> 00:29:42,580
What?

317
00:29:42,580 --> 00:29:43,580
He is.

318
00:29:43,580 --> 00:29:44,580
It's on the bone structure.

319
00:29:49,580 --> 00:29:51,580
Oh, whoa, whoa, hey.

320
00:29:52,073 --> 00:29:54,245
Easy. You're safe.

321
00:29:56,580 --> 00:29:57,311
Earth bender!

322
00:29:57,580 --> 00:29:59,352
No, no, no! We're all friends here.

323
00:29:59,580 --> 00:30:00,580
It's okay.

324
00:30:00,580 --> 00:30:02,969
Someone woke up on the wrong side of the mountain.

325
00:30:04,020 --> 00:30:05,310
Where is she?

326
00:30:06,487 --> 00:30:08,020
Where is Avatar Sonam?

327
00:30:08,586 --> 00:30:10,020
You knew Sonam?

328
00:30:11,206 --> 00:30:12,020
Who are you?

329
00:30:13,307 --> 00:30:15,110
I don't know how to explain it,

330
00:30:15,110 --> 00:30:17,733
but you've been asleep for a long time.

331
00:30:18,805 --> 00:30:20,514
I'm the Avatar now.

332
00:30:20,943 --> 00:30:22,020
I'm Aang.

333
00:30:23,166 --> 00:30:28,020
If you're the Avatar, then Sonam.

334
00:30:30,370 --> 00:30:33,474
Well, Sonam might be long gone,

335
00:30:33,667 --> 00:30:37,020
but on the bright side, you woke up at the perfect time.

336
00:30:37,020 --> 00:30:40,020
Everyone will be amazed to see another airbender.

337
00:30:40,020 --> 00:30:42,020
Aang is not the last one anymore.

338
00:30:43,020 --> 00:30:46,020
What do you mean? Last?

339
00:30:50,020 --> 00:30:51,020
The air nomads...

340
00:30:52,020 --> 00:30:54,020
They've been wiped out.

341
00:30:54,971 --> 00:30:56,502
There's only me.

342
00:31:00,024 --> 00:31:01,248
Sonam's staff.

343
00:31:02,040 --> 00:31:05,040
Do you have it? It's our only hope now.

344
00:31:05,040 --> 00:31:09,040
What do you mean? I thought it was a weapon.

345
00:31:09,669 --> 00:31:14,040
The staff is no weapon. It is a gift.

346
00:31:15,707 --> 00:31:21,040
With it, Sonam was able to channel the vast power of the Spirit World.

347
00:31:21,040 --> 00:31:25,040
It was this power that allowed Geronah to flourish.

348
00:31:25,090 --> 00:31:30,009
The greatest city in the world, an air nomad utopia,

349
00:31:30,009 --> 00:31:33,611
where Sonam presided over a golden age of balance,

350
00:31:34,090 --> 00:31:38,090
and where I devoted my life to serving her.

351
00:31:38,090 --> 00:31:40,069
In return she raised me up,

352
00:31:40,069 --> 00:31:43,784
and used her staff to give me, a lowly non-bender,

353
00:31:43,784 --> 00:31:46,784
The power to bend the air.

354
00:31:47,090 --> 00:31:51,090
I was the first, but I would not be the last.

355
00:31:51,580 --> 00:31:53,575
She filled the skies with air benders,

356
00:31:54,287 --> 00:31:58,005
and we flew by her side spreading peace across the world.

357
00:32:06,600 --> 00:32:09,580
Aang? Are you okay?

358
00:32:10,580 --> 00:32:13,580
Sonam used the staff to give people airbending.

359
00:32:14,580 --> 00:32:15,656
If we found it,

360
00:32:17,501 --> 00:32:20,108
I could bring airbending back to the world.

361
00:32:20,813 --> 00:32:22,113
This is incredible

362
00:32:22,113 --> 00:32:24,442
There haven't been airbenders for over a hundred years!

363
00:32:25,310 --> 00:32:29,310
This is everything you ever wanted, Aang.

364
00:32:29,310 --> 00:32:34,310
We could heal the greatest atrocity my nation committed in the war.

365
00:32:34,310 --> 00:32:37,310
This could be the final step to rebuilding the world.

366
00:32:37,310 --> 00:32:41,310
Not if the Denied get there first, they have the map.

367
00:32:42,126 --> 00:32:43,310
Who are the Denied?

368
00:32:43,310 --> 00:32:45,310
A group of violent non-benders.

369
00:32:46,019 --> 00:32:50,310
They... they must be after the staff to give themselves airbending.

370
00:32:50,730 --> 00:32:53,930
Then there's no time to waste. There's only one place it could be.

371
00:32:53,930 --> 00:32:58,130
Ready your bison. We'll need to travel across the endless ocean.

372
00:32:58,130 --> 00:33:01,330
On the other side of the world? But there's nothing out there.

373
00:33:01,330 --> 00:33:06,530
There's an island. The journey will not be easy. But we can make it.

374
00:33:07,530 --> 00:33:08,930
Then let's get going.

375
00:33:10,113 --> 00:33:12,636
The skies are no place for a water child.

376
00:33:12,730 --> 00:33:14,530
Water child?

377
00:33:14,530 --> 00:33:18,538
Um, I know you just woke up after thousands of years,

378
00:33:18,538 --> 00:33:20,512
but we do these things together.

379
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:22,640
Trust me, we're stronger this way.

380
00:33:22,640 --> 00:33:24,640
Welcome to Team Avatar.

381
00:33:24,640 --> 00:33:26,640
What's your name?

382
00:33:26,640 --> 00:33:27,640
Taga.

383
00:33:28,494 --> 00:33:29,640
My name is Taga.

384
00:33:39,726 --> 00:33:42,640
Just think of it as a big metal airbison.

385
00:33:50,862 --> 00:33:54,007
We will travel ancient paths through the sky.

386
00:33:55,491 --> 00:33:59,329
Ones, that our people learned by following the great airbison herds

387
00:33:59,329 --> 00:34:01,499
that long ago taught us airbending.

388
00:34:02,040 --> 00:34:04,856
Air currents known only to us.

389
00:34:04,856 --> 00:34:08,218
Encircling the Great Sphere of existance.

390
00:34:08,540 --> 00:34:10,925
Allowing us to travel where we wish,

391
00:34:10,925 --> 00:34:15,597
giving us our name, the air nomads.

392
00:34:44,707 --> 00:34:46,302
What is he doing?

393
00:34:47,150 --> 00:34:49,150
He's really feeling that air.

394
00:34:49,150 --> 00:34:52,150
He's navigating by instinct.

395
00:34:52,150 --> 00:34:54,150
What if his instincts are just wrong?

396
00:34:54,150 --> 00:34:57,150
Who needs instincts, when you've got muscles like that?

397
00:34:57,150 --> 00:35:00,150
Or what if his brain is messed up from being frozen?

398
00:35:00,150 --> 00:35:01,150
Like me?

399
00:35:01,150 --> 00:35:02,150
Uh, no!

400
00:35:02,150 --> 00:35:05,150
Oh, he was frozen for 5,000 years.

401
00:35:05,150 --> 00:35:07,150
Okay, you were frozen for what, a hundred?

402
00:35:07,150 --> 00:35:10,150
Okay, that's nothing, you're brain is...

403
00:35:10,150 --> 00:35:12,150
You're fresh.

404
00:35:12,150 --> 00:35:14,150
Maybe he's a little old fashioned, but...

405
00:35:14,150 --> 00:35:19,498
Look at him! He's so in tune with his element, he can travel across the entire ocean,

406
00:35:19,498 --> 00:35:22,120
with no map, no instruments.

407
00:35:24,288 --> 00:35:27,150
There's so much I can learn from him.

408
00:35:38,386 --> 00:35:41,673
I'll give anything to be able to see my airbison again.

409
00:35:45,184 --> 00:35:46,540
And now.

410
00:35:46,978 --> 00:35:49,978
To see only one remains...

411
00:35:51,149 --> 00:35:52,122
Aang

412
00:35:53,067 --> 00:35:55,410
You said our people where wiped out.

413
00:35:55,410 --> 00:35:58,302
Yet you survived. How?

414
00:36:00,568 --> 00:36:02,998
I just found out I was the Avatar.

415
00:36:03,419 --> 00:36:06,419
But... the responsibility.

416
00:36:06,419 --> 00:36:08,141
It was too much.

417
00:36:09,063 --> 00:36:10,758
So I run away.

418
00:36:12,031 --> 00:36:15,343
While I was gone, a Fire nation attacked.

419
00:36:17,593 --> 00:36:19,404
They were looking for me.

420
00:36:21,220 --> 00:36:24,220
If... if I've just been there.

421
00:36:24,974 --> 00:36:27,400
Sonam would say.

422
00:36:27,400 --> 00:36:30,400
Air nomads are formed from the mist.

423
00:36:30,400 --> 00:36:33,400
You walk the world for a moment in time.

424
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:37,400
Then we return to the eternal wind.

425
00:36:37,400 --> 00:36:40,400
Monk Giatso taught me that.

426
00:36:40,400 --> 00:36:42,400
We carry the same weight.

427
00:36:42,400 --> 00:36:45,400
A grief no one else could possibly comprehend.

428
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:48,400
But you and I can heal the past.

429
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:52,400
Let me show you how powerful our element can be

430
00:36:52,810 --> 00:36:54,810
when airbenders work together.

431
00:36:58,132 --> 00:37:00,134
Aaaah!!! What are you doing?!

432
00:37:01,344 --> 00:37:03,266
This is how Sonam taught me.

433
00:37:03,429 --> 00:37:05,501
Feel the energy that tethers us.

434
00:37:11,521 --> 00:37:14,312
The bond between us. Can you feel it?

435
00:37:14,312 --> 00:37:15,441
Use it.

436
00:37:15,566 --> 00:37:17,742
This is amazing!

437
00:37:24,992 --> 00:37:26,123
Human Boomer-Aang

438
00:37:26,174 --> 00:37:27,543
He is actually flying

439
00:37:27,566 --> 00:37:29,234
So are we.

440
00:37:29,295 --> 00:37:31,165
That's my best friend! That's my best friend!

441
00:37:32,500 --> 00:37:34,044
Now you throw me!

442
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:04,407
I had no idea this is possible.

443
00:38:04,796 --> 00:38:06,591
This is only the beginning.

444
00:38:13,916 --> 00:38:15,380
I can't believe it.

445
00:38:16,127 --> 00:38:18,342
Air benders will fill the sky again.

446
00:38:18,342 --> 00:38:20,924
We have been given a great gift.

447
00:38:21,132 --> 00:38:23,314
The chance to redeem ourselves.

448
00:38:23,656 --> 00:38:26,170
You were destined to find me on that mountain, Aang.

449
00:38:28,670 --> 00:38:30,670
How did you end up there?

450
00:38:34,170 --> 00:38:36,170
The Earthbenders had attacked Geronah.

451
00:38:37,170 --> 00:38:40,170
Sonam and I fought furiously, side by side.

452
00:38:40,170 --> 00:38:42,170
We drove them back to Mount Bai-hu.

453
00:38:42,170 --> 00:38:44,170
And that's the last I remember.

454
00:38:46,670 --> 00:38:48,170
She must have saved your life.

455
00:38:48,633 --> 00:38:51,170
Only an avatar could have put you in that sphere.

456
00:38:54,916 --> 00:38:55,836
Aang.

457
00:38:55,836 --> 00:38:57,977
Can I ask you something?

458
00:38:58,320 --> 00:38:59,320
Of course.

459
00:38:59,320 --> 00:39:02,425
If the Fire Nation destroyed the Air nomads,

460
00:39:02,886 --> 00:39:06,016
how can you suffer the presence of the Fire Lord?

461
00:39:09,320 --> 00:39:11,320
Zuko is a friend and an ally.

462
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:14,320
He turned against his own father to help me end the war.

463
00:39:14,320 --> 00:39:17,320
Yet he wears the crown himself now.

464
00:39:18,692 --> 00:39:21,787
Fire by its nature burns, Aang...

465
00:39:22,234 --> 00:39:25,746
Our kind have always suffered at the hands of the other elements.

466
00:39:26,989 --> 00:39:29,170
That's why we've built the Republic City

467
00:39:29,617 --> 00:39:34,970
to show the world that if we listened to each other, we can all live together, in peace.

468
00:39:36,018 --> 00:39:40,130
And once we bring back air benders, it'll be complete.

469
00:39:43,506 --> 00:39:48,312
When everyone stuck to their own, the whole world was nearly torn apart.

470
00:39:48,620 --> 00:39:55,620
And besides, Katara, Soka, Zuko, Toph, they're my family now.

471
00:39:56,630 --> 00:39:58,630
I wanna live in a world where we can all be together.

472
00:40:00,870 --> 00:40:03,234
You remind me so much of Sonam.

473
00:40:08,130 --> 00:40:09,130
It's the Avatar!

474
00:40:09,630 --> 00:40:11,630
And this time he's got his friends with him.

475
00:40:11,830 --> 00:40:13,330
That's the Fire Lord's airship.

476
00:40:13,349 --> 00:40:14,630
How did they get ahead of us?

477
00:40:14,830 --> 00:40:16,130
They don't even have the map!

478
00:40:16,630 --> 00:40:18,630
We can't risk him getting to the staff first.

479
00:40:19,130 --> 00:40:20,630
- Kill him
- But he's spared our lives.

480
00:40:21,630 --> 00:40:25,130
And how many countless were killed in that hundred years, waiting for his return?

481
00:40:25,420 --> 00:40:28,200
Where was he when your family was wiped out?

482
00:40:28,200 --> 00:40:31,800
If we want anything to change, we need what the benders have.

483
00:40:31,800 --> 00:40:32,800
Power.

484
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:41,800
Ah!

485
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:49,640
It's the Denied!

486
00:40:51,880 --> 00:40:54,140
Ah, we are definitely under attack!

487
00:40:55,703 --> 00:40:57,121
Tear them to shreads!

488
00:41:10,176 --> 00:41:12,181
Is he... crushing the ship?

489
00:41:13,724 --> 00:41:14,972
Taga?

490
00:41:15,639 --> 00:41:17,059
Taga! Stop!

491
00:41:42,291 --> 00:41:43,339
We're here.

492
00:41:45,849 --> 00:41:47,341
The immortal storm.

493
00:41:48,074 --> 00:41:49,145
Oh, no.

494
00:41:54,845 --> 00:41:56,977
There has to be another way around.

495
00:41:57,140 --> 00:41:59,517
No, together you and I can clear a path the ship

496
00:41:59,517 --> 00:42:01,028
But we have to go now.

497
00:42:01,727 --> 00:42:04,028
Aang, trust me.

498
00:42:07,733 --> 00:42:09,864
Maybe now's a good time to turn back.

499
00:42:10,140 --> 00:42:12,140
I don't think that's an option anymore.

500
00:42:12,140 --> 00:42:14,140
Where are they going?

501
00:42:22,137 --> 00:42:23,200
The engine's out!

502
00:42:23,200 --> 00:42:24,416
We're loosing air pressure!

503
00:42:30,520 --> 00:42:31,924
Katara! Toph! Come with me!

504
00:42:31,924 --> 00:42:32,591
What about me?

505
00:42:32,591 --> 00:42:36,428
- Take the wheel.
- What?! I've only ever crashed fire nation airships.

506
00:42:38,180 --> 00:42:41,521
Ok, let's see. There is the rudder, there is the elevator, this is our balast

507
00:42:41,521 --> 00:42:43,853
And there's the giant tornado that's going to kill us all.

508
00:42:47,367 --> 00:42:48,651
Follow my lead!

509
00:43:00,139 --> 00:43:01,284
Work with me.

510
00:43:01,284 --> 00:43:02,667
Just like I showed you.

511
00:43:03,255 --> 00:43:04,629
We can harness it.

512
00:43:14,633 --> 00:43:17,354
Yes! That's it, Aang! Keep going!

513
00:43:30,011 --> 00:43:30,787
Got it!

514
00:43:34,236 --> 00:43:38,073
Zuko! Zuko, Aang and Taga are destroying tornadoes,

515
00:43:38,073 --> 00:43:40,826
But there is too many! And they're everywhere!

516
00:43:40,868 --> 00:43:42,995
Just steer the ship. And don't lose Aang.

517
00:43:42,995 --> 00:43:44,330
It's not that easy.

518
00:43:44,330 --> 00:43:46,582
Especially when everything is sideways.

519
00:43:46,582 --> 00:43:48,592
Ok, left.

520
00:43:56,236 --> 00:43:58,431
Ahahaha!!! I did it!

521
00:43:58,801 --> 00:44:00,308
Ah! Right!

522
00:44:09,165 --> 00:44:10,731
No! We're falling behind!

523
00:44:11,798 --> 00:44:13,234
I'm losing sight of them!

524
00:44:13,234 --> 00:44:14,610
We have to go back!

525
00:44:14,610 --> 00:44:18,371
Trust in your friends. They won't make it if we don't clear a path.

526
00:44:31,833 --> 00:44:34,046
Zuko! We're gonna crush into the sea!

527
00:44:34,046 --> 00:44:36,845
When I give you the signal, pull the lever next to the wheel.

528
00:44:41,418 --> 00:44:43,055
We're gonna crush! We're gonna crush!

529
00:44:43,563 --> 00:44:44,685
Katara?

530
00:45:04,796 --> 00:45:06,287
Give me the signal, give me the signal!

531
00:45:11,187 --> 00:45:11,918
Closed!

532
00:45:13,626 --> 00:45:15,131
Soka! Now!

533
00:45:15,445 --> 00:45:16,797
Here we go!

534
00:45:39,351 --> 00:45:40,199
Katara!

535
00:45:40,199 --> 00:45:41,572
We did it!

536
00:45:42,440 --> 00:45:43,782
What were you thinking?!

537
00:45:43,782 --> 00:45:45,659
I was clearing the tornadoes to make a path.

538
00:45:45,659 --> 00:45:48,037
This ship almost crushed, Aang. We could have died!

539
00:45:48,037 --> 00:45:51,052
And what if you got yourself killed? You're the Avatar!

540
00:45:51,387 --> 00:45:54,140
This is too risky. We need to turn back now.

541
00:45:54,140 --> 00:45:57,140
No, we're almost there.

542
00:45:57,140 --> 00:46:00,140
We just need to get into the eye of the storm.

543
00:46:00,140 --> 00:46:02,807
Aang, no! This is too dangerous.

544
00:46:02,807 --> 00:46:05,307
The staff is out there. The Denied are after it.

545
00:46:05,637 --> 00:46:08,140
Do you really believe that they can make it through the storm?

546
00:46:08,140 --> 00:46:11,140
We're nearly there. That staff can bring back my people.

547
00:46:11,140 --> 00:46:13,140
I understand how much you want that.

548
00:46:13,140 --> 00:46:14,816
You don't understand! None of you do!

549
00:46:16,140 --> 00:46:17,237
Aang...

550
00:46:19,710 --> 00:46:21,710
We push forward.

551
00:46:24,710 --> 00:46:27,710
If we generate enough air we can push our way through.

552
00:47:12,907 --> 00:47:16,710
We're alive? We made it through. Thank you, Taga.

553
00:47:16,710 --> 00:47:19,710
It was you, Aang. We're here because of you.

554
00:47:19,710 --> 00:47:21,915
Yeah, we're having a good time, too.

555
00:47:21,915 --> 00:47:24,216
Could have told us we were flying into the immortal storm.

556
00:47:24,216 --> 00:47:26,885
I know it was dangerous, but we had to risk it.

557
00:47:26,927 --> 00:47:27,920
We?

558
00:47:28,322 --> 00:47:30,392
I don't remember when we took a vote on that.

559
00:47:30,458 --> 00:47:31,509
There wasn't time.

560
00:47:31,688 --> 00:47:32,497
I had to make a call...

561
00:47:32,705 --> 00:47:33,920
Please, don't blame Aang.

562
00:47:34,562 --> 00:47:35,920
This is all my fault.

563
00:47:35,920 --> 00:47:37,920
I knew this would be difficult.

564
00:47:38,892 --> 00:47:40,920
But Aang believed in your strength as a team.

565
00:47:41,662 --> 00:47:43,496
And I'm honored to be a part of it.

566
00:47:49,656 --> 00:47:51,161
I forgive you, Taga.

567
00:47:51,191 --> 00:47:52,298
Everyone.

568
00:47:52,800 --> 00:47:53,415
Look.

569
00:47:54,770 --> 00:47:55,714
This islands.

570
00:47:56,357 --> 00:47:58,870
They were... Lion-turtles.

571
00:48:02,983 --> 00:48:04,685
It's beautiful.

572
00:48:06,832 --> 00:48:08,875
Long before my time,

573
00:48:08,875 --> 00:48:12,394
the Lion-turtles granted the gift of bending to humans.

574
00:48:12,850 --> 00:48:16,450
These are their final resting grounds.

575
00:48:16,450 --> 00:48:20,450
This is where Sonam came to learn their ways.

576
00:48:20,450 --> 00:48:23,810
I am certain that she left her staff here.

577
00:48:23,810 --> 00:48:24,938
Where should we start looking?

578
00:48:25,194 --> 00:48:28,194
Aang. You must connect with her.

579
00:48:29,163 --> 00:48:29,951
But...

580
00:48:30,420 --> 00:48:31,867
Noone can connect with Sonam.

581
00:48:32,260 --> 00:48:35,860
The spiritual power of the lion-turtles is still concentrated here.

582
00:48:35,860 --> 00:48:37,460
Let it guide you.

583
00:48:37,460 --> 00:48:39,300
We'll set out immediately.

584
00:48:39,300 --> 00:48:40,460
Actually, Taga,

585
00:48:40,460 --> 00:48:42,740
We could really use your help here.

586
00:48:42,740 --> 00:48:45,700
If the Denied are close behind, we need to be ready.

587
00:48:45,700 --> 00:48:49,460
Yeah, and we're gonna need more than Toph's metal bending to fix that ship.

588
00:48:49,460 --> 00:48:51,620
My bending got a through that storm.

589
00:48:51,620 --> 00:48:52,580
What did you do?

590
00:48:52,580 --> 00:48:54,180
Steered with his feet.

591
00:48:54,180 --> 00:48:55,540
Repairs can wait.

592
00:48:55,540 --> 00:48:56,740
Aang needs me.

593
00:48:56,740 --> 00:48:57,940
Taga.

594
00:48:57,940 --> 00:48:59,140
Please.

595
00:48:59,300 --> 00:49:02,300
Stay and help my friends. I'll be okay on my own.

596
00:49:03,300 --> 00:49:07,300
As you wish, we will begin repairs for our voyage home.

597
00:49:09,300 --> 00:49:10,300
Everyone?

598
00:49:11,300 --> 00:49:13,300
I know I've asked a lot of you on this journey.

599
00:49:14,300 --> 00:49:17,300
But we're about to accomplish something that will change the world.

600
00:50:09,256 --> 00:50:10,768
Let it guide you...

601
00:50:27,529 --> 00:50:28,442
Sonam?

602
00:50:46,655 --> 00:50:50,270
Aah, this is turning out to be a nice little vacation.

603
00:50:50,440 --> 00:50:54,009
Aside from all the people trying to kill us. And the tornadoes.

604
00:50:54,676 --> 00:50:56,553
We're supposed to be fixing the ship.

605
00:50:56,607 --> 00:50:58,059
You're doing great, buddy.

606
00:50:58,440 --> 00:51:00,440
Has anyone seen Taga?

607
00:51:00,440 --> 00:51:05,440
Yes, we've all seen Taga, He's so gorgeous. Geez, I get it.

608
00:51:05,440 --> 00:51:08,440
Oh, I see what you mean. You wandered off that way.

609
00:51:08,440 --> 00:51:11,440
No, maybe. That way.

610
00:51:44,787 --> 00:51:47,490
Taga! Where are you going?

611
00:51:48,345 --> 00:51:50,120
Aang needs to be protected.

612
00:51:50,482 --> 00:51:51,720
I agree.

613
00:51:54,611 --> 00:51:56,875
I know my ways may seem unusual to you.

614
00:51:57,549 --> 00:51:58,857
But I assure you.

615
00:51:59,211 --> 00:52:01,898
Everything I do, I do for Aang.

616
00:52:02,048 --> 00:52:04,870
For Aang? Or for the staff?

617
00:52:05,803 --> 00:52:08,409
You have no idea at all what we've lost.

618
00:52:08,409 --> 00:52:10,919
You've never known a world of airbenders.

619
00:52:11,850 --> 00:52:15,733
I know Aang. He may be the last of this kind,

620
00:52:15,733 --> 00:52:18,733
But he's the reason this world knows peace.

621
00:52:21,850 --> 00:52:26,850
His values, as an air nomad have brought balance to chaos.

622
00:52:27,850 --> 00:52:37,850
It's because of Aang that the water tribes, earth kingdom, and fire nation now work together, striving for harmony.

623
00:52:37,850 --> 00:52:40,850
A peace we once thought, unattainable.

624
00:52:42,117 --> 00:52:43,850
You speak of peace.

625
00:52:43,850 --> 00:52:46,850
There will never be peace among the elements.

626
00:52:47,183 --> 00:52:48,503
There never was.

627
00:52:48,687 --> 00:52:51,850
Your precious Republic City is built on lies.

628
00:52:51,850 --> 00:52:53,850
It's built on hope.

629
00:52:54,415 --> 00:52:55,988
Do you have hope, Taga?

630
00:52:56,006 --> 00:52:58,850
Saving my people requires more than just hope.

631
00:52:58,850 --> 00:53:00,850
It requires sacrifice.

632
00:53:00,850 --> 00:53:03,850
I saw you try to crush the Denied's airships.

633
00:53:03,850 --> 00:53:05,850
You were ready to kill them.

634
00:53:07,850 --> 00:53:10,648
I know, what kind of airbender Aang is.

635
00:53:12,931 --> 00:53:14,984
But what kind of airbender are you?

636
00:53:44,015 --> 00:53:45,891
Aang did well getting us here

637
00:53:46,068 --> 00:53:47,975
There's great strength in him.

638
00:53:48,351 --> 00:53:50,900
But weakness as well.

639
00:53:50,900 --> 00:53:51,900
weakness?

640
00:53:51,900 --> 00:53:52,900
Yes.

641
00:53:52,900 --> 00:53:53,900
You.

642
00:54:10,455 --> 00:54:11,581
What the hog-monkey?!

643
00:54:15,460 --> 00:54:16,419
No!

644
00:54:35,230 --> 00:54:36,523
He trusted you!

645
00:54:43,822 --> 00:54:44,781
No...

646
00:55:38,120 --> 00:55:39,042
Taga!

647
00:56:05,154 --> 00:56:06,108
Brother.

648
00:56:08,930 --> 00:56:10,079
Taga.

649
00:56:10,079 --> 00:56:11,993
It's real.

650
00:56:16,015 --> 00:56:18,333
We can finally bring back air bending.

651
00:56:21,468 --> 00:56:22,837
Let's go tell the others.

652
00:56:23,004 --> 00:56:24,593
WE can do this.

653
00:56:24,923 --> 00:56:26,257
Me and you.

654
00:56:27,075 --> 00:56:28,885
I can't do this without my friends.

655
00:56:31,211 --> 00:56:34,211
Earth killed my people. Fire killed yours.

656
00:56:34,349 --> 00:56:38,385
The staff is the only way we can create a new Air empire.

657
00:56:38,487 --> 00:56:40,980
One capable of defending itself.

658
00:56:40,980 --> 00:56:43,980
No. We can build a new future, Taga.

659
00:56:43,980 --> 00:56:45,980
But it has to be for everyone.

660
00:56:45,980 --> 00:56:48,313
The staff doesn't belong to everyone.

661
00:56:48,546 --> 00:56:49,980
It belongs to us.

662
00:56:49,980 --> 00:56:51,980
What? What have you done?

663
00:56:51,980 --> 00:56:54,980
As long as they were around, you always put them ahead of our people.

664
00:56:55,849 --> 00:56:56,980
Don't you see?

665
00:56:56,980 --> 00:56:58,980
This is how we redeem ourselves.

666
00:56:59,916 --> 00:57:01,557
It doesn't matter that you ran then.

667
00:57:01,885 --> 00:57:03,980
As long as you stand with me now.

668
00:57:03,980 --> 00:57:05,980
- No.
- Aang, listen to me.

669
00:57:05,980 --> 00:57:06,688
Katara...

670
00:57:06,688 --> 00:57:08,133
This is the only way...

671
00:57:22,209 --> 00:57:25,972
Surrender to your own. Just like Sonam.

672
00:58:03,980 --> 00:58:06,024
I wanted to do this with you by my side.

673
00:58:07,442 --> 00:58:12,570
But if I must build a new air empire alone, so be it.

674
00:58:20,747 --> 00:58:22,540
There is no way in!

675
00:58:22,540 --> 00:58:23,917
We have to turn back!

676
00:58:23,958 --> 00:58:26,753
No! We keep trying to push through!

677
00:58:39,120 --> 00:58:40,771
Sonam's staff...

678
00:58:41,270 --> 00:58:45,146
Denied! The Avatar is dead.

679
00:58:45,270 --> 00:58:48,359
If you wish to build a new world where you have the power,

680
00:58:48,359 --> 00:58:50,318
I can give it to you.

681
00:59:05,386 --> 00:59:06,041
Appa!

682
00:59:06,519 --> 00:59:07,420
Katara!

683
00:59:08,545 --> 00:59:09,911
Katara!

684
00:59:13,133 --> 00:59:14,437
They're gone...

685
00:59:15,065 --> 00:59:16,563
It's all my fault.

686
00:59:17,381 --> 00:59:19,017
It's always been my fault.

687
00:59:19,639 --> 00:59:21,436
Ever since I've run away.

688
00:59:23,216 --> 00:59:26,648
No Avatar has ever fallen into such shame,

689
00:59:26,648 --> 00:59:29,027
As to join me here in my sorrow.

690
00:59:31,121 --> 00:59:33,820
Why do you grief so, friend?

691
00:59:33,820 --> 00:59:35,155
Avatar Sonam?

692
00:59:38,315 --> 00:59:39,820
Taga murdered my friends.

693
00:59:40,527 --> 00:59:41,820
And now he has a staff.

694
00:59:41,820 --> 00:59:46,820
Taga? No, no, I stopped him.

695
00:59:46,820 --> 00:59:48,820
I hid the staff.

696
00:59:49,240 --> 00:59:51,240
What have you done?

697
00:59:51,928 --> 00:59:54,240
You're the one who gave him airbending!

698
00:59:54,240 --> 00:59:57,240
How could you give power to a monster?

699
00:59:57,240 --> 00:59:59,240
The Taga I gave bending to

700
00:59:59,978 --> 01:00:01,240
was a different man.

701
01:00:02,598 --> 01:00:04,240
It was a different time.

702
01:00:05,155 --> 01:00:08,240
The air benders were the peacekeepers of the four elements.

703
01:00:08,789 --> 01:00:12,240
We used our power to mediate all conflict with no violence.

704
01:00:13,178 --> 01:00:15,240
But we were the fewest among us.

705
01:00:16,440 --> 01:00:21,117
For many years, we existed in a beautiful balance of great prosperity,

706
01:00:21,117 --> 01:00:23,590
but the world began to shift.

707
01:00:24,065 --> 01:00:29,440
The earth benders formed their own kingdom, separating from the other elemental tribes.

708
01:00:29,440 --> 01:00:34,440
The balance of the world was at risk. It was my duty to act.

709
01:00:35,215 --> 01:00:39,440
So I learned how to channel the energy of the spirit world just as the Lion-turtles did.

710
01:00:40,136 --> 01:00:43,440
To give people the power of airbending.

711
01:00:44,090 --> 01:00:48,490
My most devout pupil, Taga, was the first to receive it.

712
01:00:49,690 --> 01:00:53,650
I sent my new peacekeepers out to help calm the growing unrest.

713
01:00:54,810 --> 01:00:58,696
But they were not prepared for the brutality of the new Earth Kingdom

714
01:01:01,370 --> 01:01:06,090
Taga watched, as his brothers and sisters were all slaughtered.

715
01:01:07,450 --> 01:01:10,250
His heart darkened by the violence of war.

716
01:01:10,810 --> 01:01:14,810
He now saw everyone who wasn't an air nomad as the enemy.

717
01:01:15,810 --> 01:01:20,810
Taga begged me to use the staff to create an army and to kill all who would do us harm.

718
01:01:21,549 --> 01:01:22,810
I refused

719
01:01:23,281 --> 01:01:24,810
So he stole it

720
01:01:25,850 --> 01:01:27,810
When he connected the staff to the temple

721
01:01:27,810 --> 01:01:31,397
His energy was so corrupted by grief and rage,

722
01:01:31,475 --> 01:01:34,243
That the power of the Spirit World consumed him.

723
01:01:35,644 --> 01:01:38,370
Taga became something more than human

724
01:01:38,894 --> 01:01:40,121
Too powerful to kill.

725
01:01:41,197 --> 01:01:44,197
It took all my energy to finally trap him,

726
01:01:44,197 --> 01:01:47,434
high above the clouds, where noone would find him.

727
01:01:48,528 --> 01:01:52,540
I reclaimed the staff, but I was fataly wounded.

728
01:01:53,250 --> 01:01:55,677
Before the Earth Kingdom could invade Geronah,

729
01:01:55,677 --> 01:01:58,677
I sent the remaining air nomads into the mountains,

730
01:01:59,570 --> 01:02:03,650
and I hid my temple in the spirit world, where no one could access its power.

731
01:02:06,230 --> 01:02:08,230
Then I locked the staff away.

732
01:02:08,230 --> 01:02:11,230
Where only the Avatar could find it.

733
01:02:12,230 --> 01:02:15,230
I died, hoping, that one day,

734
01:02:15,230 --> 01:02:20,230
Another Avatar will create more air benders and restore balance to this world.

735
01:02:20,230 --> 01:02:23,338
And that Avatar is you, Aang.

736
01:02:23,448 --> 01:02:27,145
You have to get my stuff before Taga connects it to the temple.

737
01:02:27,230 --> 01:02:31,230
There's still time. Don't let my regret become yours.

738
01:02:31,830 --> 01:02:34,230
My friends and I fought hard for this peace.

739
01:02:34,950 --> 01:02:36,950
I won't let him start another war.

740
01:02:37,421 --> 01:02:38,950
Help me find a way back.

741
01:02:40,530 --> 01:02:41,687
Sonam?

742
01:02:42,950 --> 01:02:43,950
What's happening?

743
01:02:43,950 --> 01:02:44,950
Woo!

744
01:02:46,254 --> 01:02:46,950
No!

745
01:02:46,950 --> 01:02:47,950
No!

746
01:02:47,950 --> 01:02:50,516
Please, I have to fix this!

747
01:02:50,650 --> 01:02:51,724
This can't be it!

748
01:02:51,876 --> 01:02:52,927
I can't die yet!

749
01:02:52,950 --> 01:02:53,950
Please!

750
01:02:53,950 --> 01:02:54,950
Not yet!

751
01:02:54,950 --> 01:02:55,605
No!

752
01:02:55,605 --> 01:02:56,616
- Aang?
- Katara?

753
01:03:02,141 --> 01:03:03,145
Aang!

754
01:03:04,970 --> 01:03:07,214
- Katara!
- I was so worried.

755
01:03:07,519 --> 01:03:08,332
Aang!

756
01:03:08,970 --> 01:03:09,970
Soka!

757
01:03:09,970 --> 01:03:10,970
Ugh!

758
01:03:10,970 --> 01:03:12,970
I knew you'd pull through, buddy.

759
01:03:13,035 --> 01:03:13,970
- Hey, Aang
- Zuko!

760
01:03:14,790 --> 01:03:15,790
Momo!

761
01:03:16,596 --> 01:03:18,212
Welcome back, Twinkle Toes.

762
01:03:18,212 --> 01:03:18,924
Toph!

763
01:03:19,087 --> 01:03:19,928
You're okay.

764
01:03:21,381 --> 01:03:22,790
I thought you were all dead.

765
01:03:22,790 --> 01:03:23,790
We were.

766
01:03:23,790 --> 01:03:25,790
But, Katara saved us.

767
01:03:26,386 --> 01:03:30,790
The spiritual power of this water strengthen my healing abilities.

768
01:03:32,790 --> 01:03:34,790
You're incredible, Katara.

769
01:03:36,790 --> 01:03:37,790
Where's Appa?

770
01:03:39,344 --> 01:03:40,790
Taga must have taken him.

771
01:03:41,650 --> 01:03:42,790
I'm sorry.

772
01:03:45,736 --> 01:03:48,160
I can't believe I trusted him.

773
01:03:49,711 --> 01:03:51,160
We'll get through this.

774
01:03:54,160 --> 01:03:56,160
So, let me get this straight.

775
01:03:56,160 --> 01:03:59,160
He's pulling Sonam's temple out of the Spirit World,

776
01:03:59,160 --> 01:04:01,160
to gain unlimited power.

777
01:04:01,160 --> 01:04:04,160
And let me guess, you want us to stop him?

778
01:04:04,160 --> 01:04:07,160
Sure, only problem is your air bro crushed our ship

779
01:04:07,160 --> 01:04:09,160
and stole your bison.

780
01:04:09,160 --> 01:04:11,160
Also, there's a massive typhoon

781
01:04:11,160 --> 01:04:12,160
Surrounding us!

782
01:04:15,518 --> 01:04:17,160
I don't say this very often, but...

783
01:04:17,160 --> 01:04:19,160
...Soka is right.

784
01:04:19,160 --> 01:04:20,160
Thank you.

785
01:04:20,160 --> 01:04:21,160
Yup, we're stuck.

786
01:04:21,160 --> 01:04:24,160
And there aren't enough Lion-turtles for all of us to have our own island,

787
01:04:24,160 --> 01:04:26,160
So, I'm calling this one.

788
01:04:26,160 --> 01:04:27,160
I'm naming him Snappy.

789
01:04:27,618 --> 01:04:29,796
Ah, Snappy is the best one.

790
01:04:29,852 --> 01:04:30,525
I know.

791
01:04:31,130 --> 01:04:33,160
We may not know where Taga is.

792
01:04:33,666 --> 01:04:36,766
But we know what he's looking for is in the Spirit World.

793
01:04:37,471 --> 01:04:38,603
And lucky for us.

794
01:04:38,788 --> 01:04:42,160
We're stuck in the most spiritually charged place on the planet.

795
01:04:42,870 --> 01:04:45,870
So I may be able to open a portal to get us there.

796
01:04:45,870 --> 01:04:48,870
If I can summon an old friend.

797
01:04:57,299 --> 01:05:00,647
Wow, the ocean's spirit.

798
01:05:08,870 --> 01:05:11,578
This portal smells awful lot like the fish market.

799
01:05:11,870 --> 01:05:13,159
I'm gonna go check on Snappy.

800
01:05:13,305 --> 01:05:15,672
Face your death with honor.

801
01:05:15,870 --> 01:05:16,870
I'm sorry.

802
01:05:16,870 --> 01:05:20,870
I know I got us into this, but I promise you, I'll fix it.

803
01:05:20,870 --> 01:05:22,870
We'll fix it.

804
01:05:22,870 --> 01:05:24,870
Together.

805
01:05:40,080 --> 01:05:41,960
What? Where's my power-pony?

806
01:05:42,707 --> 01:05:44,960
Were my hands always this small?

807
01:05:44,960 --> 01:05:47,860
Aah! It's baby-Toph! Baby-Toph!

808
01:05:49,290 --> 01:05:50,863
What the hog-monkey?!

809
01:05:51,364 --> 01:05:53,503
Aah! Old people! Gran-gran?

810
01:05:53,503 --> 01:05:55,660
It's your sister, you meathead!

811
01:05:55,660 --> 01:05:58,089
Give me Toph. There, there.

812
01:05:58,089 --> 01:06:01,666
Oh no, Zuko! What happened to your beautiful face?

813
01:06:01,666 --> 01:06:03,830
You look like a dried sea squid.

814
01:06:04,374 --> 01:06:05,552
No! Zuko!

815
01:06:05,552 --> 01:06:07,923
- Ow, ow, oww!
- What's going on here?

816
01:06:08,910 --> 01:06:11,259
Spirit world is out of balance.

817
01:06:11,760 --> 01:06:12,971
And so are we.

818
01:06:15,408 --> 01:06:16,907
That's gonna be Taga.

819
01:06:39,051 --> 01:06:40,042
Oh no!

820
01:06:40,042 --> 01:06:42,732
He's pulling Sonam's temple into our world.

821
01:06:42,732 --> 01:06:44,254
We're running out of time!

822
01:06:50,992 --> 01:06:53,052
Uff... Good landing.

823
01:06:53,843 --> 01:06:56,932
Woah! Humans! I love humans!

824
01:06:56,932 --> 01:07:00,188
Two brothers, their little sister and elderly couple!

825
01:07:00,188 --> 01:07:01,697
Not a couple!

826
01:07:01,731 --> 01:07:04,103
Woah! Looks like I've touched the nerve.

827
01:07:04,103 --> 01:07:06,810
Oww, look at this one. Hello.

828
01:07:06,810 --> 01:07:10,924
- Ou!
- Toph! No! Bad Toph! Don't bite strangers

829
01:07:12,283 --> 01:07:13,868
Great Spirit! Excuse me!

830
01:07:13,922 --> 01:07:15,680
Did you just come from that temple in the sky?

831
01:07:15,905 --> 01:07:17,230
I certainly did.

832
01:07:18,159 --> 01:07:20,230
It was my favorite hiding hole until that dark,

833
01:07:20,230 --> 01:07:23,230
Yuckie energy started corrupting this whole place.

834
01:07:23,740 --> 01:07:26,637
Please, we need your help getting up there.

835
01:07:26,930 --> 01:07:28,673
It's my duty to stop this.

836
01:07:29,007 --> 01:07:31,230
I'm the Avatar.

837
01:07:31,874 --> 01:07:34,936
Ooh, the Avatar!

838
01:07:35,425 --> 01:07:36,719
Let me have a squeez at you.

839
01:07:36,719 --> 01:07:37,637
...okay.

840
01:07:37,637 --> 01:07:38,888
Now with this eye.

841
01:07:39,044 --> 01:07:39,899
And this eye?

842
01:07:39,944 --> 01:07:40,230
Mm-hmm.

843
01:07:40,230 --> 01:07:41,230
And this eye?

844
01:07:41,230 --> 01:07:43,753
Hey, can we hurry it up? Ou, ou!

845
01:07:43,753 --> 01:07:46,753
Snif tiiiime!

846
01:07:47,230 --> 01:07:49,958
Uuu, that's the Avatar, you're real, right there!

847
01:07:49,958 --> 01:07:51,108
Yes it is.

848
01:07:51,230 --> 01:07:53,516
Oh, yes, yes, yes, yes!

849
01:07:53,607 --> 01:07:58,230
It appears the universe has brought us together for a very important mission.

850
01:08:00,230 --> 01:08:01,230
To flee!

851
01:08:02,072 --> 01:08:03,579
Run for your lives!

852
01:08:04,084 --> 01:08:05,247
Wait! Come back!

853
01:08:05,437 --> 01:08:06,843
You're going the wrong way!

854
01:08:06,968 --> 01:08:10,473
Stop! Please, Great Spirit. Both of our worlds are in danger.

855
01:08:10,473 --> 01:08:13,473
Oh, no, no, no, no. I am not going back up there.

856
01:08:19,420 --> 01:08:22,710
Hmm, well when you put it like that, it does make more sense.

857
01:08:23,482 --> 01:08:27,230
Upon reflection, I decided I shall help you and your humany friends.

858
01:08:27,850 --> 01:08:28,994
What did he say?

859
01:08:29,104 --> 01:08:29,998
Nice work, Momo.

860
01:08:30,541 --> 01:08:31,875
Alright, in you go.

861
01:08:35,178 --> 01:08:37,295
Alright! Know you can't have anything you find in my teeth,

862
01:08:37,372 --> 01:08:39,000
As I'm saving that for later.

863
01:08:39,082 --> 01:08:41,249
Ready? Set.

864
01:08:41,249 --> 01:08:44,249
One, and the two, and then you know what to do.

865
01:08:44,249 --> 01:08:49,965
Blast off!

866
01:08:50,793 --> 01:08:53,352
Now, we didn't know each other very long, but

867
01:08:53,352 --> 01:08:54,966
I love you!

868
01:08:54,966 --> 01:08:56,527
You don't have to say it back.

869
01:09:05,117 --> 01:09:06,936
Hey! You got your hair back!

870
01:09:06,936 --> 01:09:08,102
Why are my eyes teary?

871
01:09:08,185 --> 01:09:09,603
Was I crying?

872
01:09:10,275 --> 01:09:12,423
No way! Look!

873
01:09:12,509 --> 01:09:13,910
What? What is it?

874
01:09:13,910 --> 01:09:15,910
It's Republic City.

875
01:09:18,910 --> 01:09:21,910
We can't let him destroy everything we built.

876
01:09:22,135 --> 01:09:23,144
We won't.

877
01:09:38,861 --> 01:09:40,186
Boomerang!

878
01:09:57,033 --> 01:09:58,861
Give me the staff, Taga!

879
01:09:58,861 --> 01:10:01,285
I see I underestimated you, Avatar.

880
01:10:01,566 --> 01:10:04,320
Your friends are stronger than I thought.

881
01:10:04,320 --> 01:10:06,320
But you're too late.

882
01:10:14,320 --> 01:10:15,320
The Denied.

883
01:10:16,045 --> 01:10:18,506
You see, I did what you wanted, Aang

884
01:10:18,576 --> 01:10:21,320
I returned airbending to the world.

885
01:10:23,220 --> 01:10:24,220
What's the plan?

886
01:10:24,220 --> 01:10:25,620
We'll deal with the Denied.

887
01:10:25,620 --> 01:10:27,860
You have to get the staff.

888
01:10:27,860 --> 01:10:31,140
I will rebuild your honor on the ruins of our enemies.

889
01:10:31,140 --> 01:10:32,780
Just as they did on ours.

890
01:10:32,780 --> 01:10:35,980
A new air-empire will rise.

891
01:10:35,980 --> 01:10:37,100
Kill them all.

892
01:10:55,459 --> 01:10:57,631
We have to get this people out of here.

893
01:11:14,105 --> 01:11:15,401
Oh yeah!

894
01:11:22,699 --> 01:11:23,950
Taga!

895
01:11:23,950 --> 01:11:25,347
Give it to me!

896
01:11:27,350 --> 01:11:28,621
This isn't the way.

897
01:11:28,621 --> 01:11:31,954
We can use the staff to bring back balance. Peace.

898
01:11:31,954 --> 01:11:35,880
You care so much about your ideals, that you've let your people die!

899
01:11:36,709 --> 01:11:39,541
I would do anything to make sure they survive!

900
01:11:57,532 --> 01:11:59,771
My cabbages! Not my cabbages!

901
01:12:06,032 --> 01:12:07,580
My cabbages...

902
01:12:07,580 --> 01:12:11,547
My cabbages!

903
01:12:24,160 --> 01:12:26,564
Don't do this! You have the power now.

904
01:12:26,564 --> 01:12:28,218
You can decide how to use it.

905
01:12:28,218 --> 01:12:30,888
I'm not like you. The world hasn't been good to me.

906
01:12:30,888 --> 01:12:32,598
The world is what we make it.

907
01:12:32,986 --> 01:12:34,242
Get away from her!

908
01:13:06,590 --> 01:13:07,797
Taga! Stop!

909
01:13:13,138 --> 01:13:15,307
You betrayed me. You betrayed our culture.

910
01:13:15,307 --> 01:13:18,058
I gave you every chance to see the truth.

911
01:13:23,868 --> 01:13:25,835
Shouldn't you be in the Fire Nation?

912
01:13:27,809 --> 01:13:30,155
I'm fighting for the peace of all nations.

913
01:13:34,106 --> 01:13:36,002
Big talk, from someone who sits on the throne

914
01:13:36,002 --> 01:13:38,166
built on the century of war.

915
01:14:00,809 --> 01:14:04,280
I'm still the greatest Earth bender in the world!

916
01:14:28,150 --> 01:14:30,680
Oh no. I'm out of water.

917
01:14:32,444 --> 01:14:34,691
Haha! We gotcha!

918
01:14:34,691 --> 01:14:37,514
And there is no Avatar here to save you.

919
01:14:39,067 --> 01:14:41,226
Soka-cycle!

920
01:14:44,897 --> 01:14:49,198
Let's see if your fancy new bending can beat some good, old, non-bending know-how.

921
01:15:04,541 --> 01:15:06,784
You just got Denied!

922
01:15:15,023 --> 01:15:17,805
- Let's go!
- Good luck saving your city.

923
01:15:26,206 --> 01:15:28,690
We have to save as many people as we can.

924
01:15:46,822 --> 01:15:50,462
I know your pain, I know what you've been through.

925
01:15:51,510 --> 01:15:53,510
You don't know.

926
01:15:53,510 --> 01:15:57,510
I watched, as all of my brothers and sisters were slaughtered,

927
01:15:58,262 --> 01:16:01,774
and the fire nation burned the air nomads to ash.

928
01:16:02,072 --> 01:16:03,510
where were you?

929
01:16:03,905 --> 01:16:05,510
You've run!

930
01:16:37,603 --> 01:16:38,785
No!

931
01:17:01,063 --> 01:17:06,663
The full power of the Spirit World flows through me!

932
01:17:16,001 --> 01:17:18,467
This is what strength looks like.

933
01:18:12,075 --> 01:18:15,508
You should have run away like you did all those years ago.

934
01:18:15,508 --> 01:18:17,067
Little Avatar.

935
01:18:17,895 --> 01:18:21,655
I... won't... run.

936
01:18:21,655 --> 01:18:25,787
Then at least you will die knowing you are not the last airbender.

937
01:19:02,571 --> 01:19:04,466
Aang!

938
01:20:20,692 --> 01:20:22,667
We could have been brothers.

939
01:20:23,154 --> 01:20:25,199
We could have done this together!

940
01:20:25,510 --> 01:20:27,575
Instead it have to end like this.

941
01:20:32,634 --> 01:20:34,208
It's Aang. He's got the staff.

942
01:20:34,399 --> 01:20:36,954
Yeah, kick his butt, Mega-Aang!

943
01:20:37,000 --> 01:20:39,000
No, something's wrong!

944
01:20:39,000 --> 01:20:41,000
The power is corrupting him.

945
01:20:58,642 --> 01:21:02,791
I dreamt of bringing the air nomads back to the world as peacekeepers.

946
01:21:03,000 --> 01:21:05,946
They could have been the beacon of light for world to follow.

947
01:21:05,946 --> 01:21:07,487
But you've ruined it!

948
01:21:07,560 --> 01:21:10,400
You twisted my dream into a nightmare!

949
01:21:10,400 --> 01:21:14,400
Finally, you have the power the air nomads need.

950
01:21:14,400 --> 01:21:17,000
Maybe there is hope for you after all.

951
01:21:27,538 --> 01:21:30,348
Do it! Use the staff.

952
01:21:30,348 --> 01:21:33,348
Show me you have the strength to bring our people back.

953
01:21:34,369 --> 01:21:35,432
Do it!

954
01:22:12,192 --> 01:22:13,571
Aang.

955
01:22:16,290 --> 01:22:19,404
You will do so many great things as the Avatar.

956
01:22:19,879 --> 01:22:23,742
but you must be prepared to do what frightens you the most.

957
01:22:25,290 --> 01:22:30,290
Your people, your home, we are always with you.

958
01:22:46,439 --> 01:22:47,560
No...

959
01:23:18,369 --> 01:23:19,425
No!

960
01:23:19,690 --> 01:23:21,690
My power!

961
01:23:27,225 --> 01:23:28,506
No...

962
01:23:28,832 --> 01:23:29,963
No!

963
01:23:39,267 --> 01:23:40,932
You fool!

964
01:23:40,932 --> 01:23:42,183
Why?

965
01:23:42,623 --> 01:23:44,949
Why did you break it?!

966
01:23:45,174 --> 01:23:47,606
We could have fixed everything.

967
01:23:48,779 --> 01:23:51,505
We can't erase the pain of the past.

968
01:23:52,694 --> 01:23:54,029
We could not save them.

969
01:23:54,029 --> 01:23:57,782
But it's our duty. To protect our people.

970
01:23:57,782 --> 01:24:01,536
Not at the cost of betraying everything they stood for.

971
01:24:01,536 --> 01:24:04,768
- No...
- It's time to let go.

972
01:24:05,450 --> 01:24:07,450
You have to forgive yourself.

973
01:24:10,450 --> 01:24:12,450
I have to forgive myself too.

974
01:24:21,450 --> 01:24:24,450
Air nomads or formed from the mist.

975
01:24:28,540 --> 01:24:32,540
We walk the world for a moment in time.

976
01:24:34,540 --> 01:24:38,540
Then we return to the eternal wind.

977
01:24:55,047 --> 01:24:56,310
Aang!

978
01:25:00,072 --> 01:25:01,524
Hey, Katara.

979
01:25:01,524 --> 01:25:02,936
Hey, Aang.

980
01:25:05,216 --> 01:25:09,062
Seriously? You do realise you're falling, right?

981
01:25:09,345 --> 01:25:13,861
Hey, if you ever get tired of relying on Appa, I can hook you up with one of these  babies

982
01:25:18,585 --> 01:25:21,585
I'll give you a "Best friends" discount.

983
01:25:35,130 --> 01:25:37,182
I don't know if Airbending will ever return,

984
01:25:38,146 --> 01:25:41,112
but I know now that the true power of the Air nomads

985
01:25:41,876 --> 01:25:44,958
was never their bending, it was their values,

986
01:25:45,589 --> 01:25:48,480
and that's a power I can pass on to others.

987
01:25:48,480 --> 01:25:54,440
Avatar Aang you are the true embodiment of the Air nomads.

988
01:25:55,069 --> 01:25:58,624
Thank you for giving up the power that I could not.

989
01:25:59,600 --> 01:26:01,720
You give me hope for the future of our culture.

990
01:26:15,835 --> 01:26:17,928
It's amazing, isn't it

991
01:26:18,563 --> 01:26:22,288
The first new air temple in the centuries.

992
01:26:22,673 --> 01:26:25,288
Republic City is finally complete.

993
01:26:29,660 --> 01:26:32,660
A city for all nations, just like you promised.

994
01:26:33,660 --> 01:26:36,660
I never could have done this without you, Katara.

995
01:26:37,660 --> 01:26:40,660
Hey everybody, sorry I kept you all waiting.

996
01:26:40,660 --> 01:26:42,660
Are you ready for our big trip?

997
01:26:43,660 --> 01:26:48,660
As my new acolites, you'll be helping me preserve our culture for future generations.

998
01:26:49,660 --> 01:26:53,660
So, who wants to search for artifact in an ancient abandoned temple?

999
01:26:53,660 --> 01:26:54,660
Yay.

1000
01:26:55,171 --> 01:26:59,338
I'm only going to make sure you don't try to release another beefy old air bender.

1001
01:26:59,413 --> 01:27:01,660
Yeah, I'm done with bad boys.

1002
01:27:13,755 --> 01:27:15,813
Avatar Sonam told me about this place.

1003
01:27:15,951 --> 01:27:19,660
So it's very possible that no one's been here in hundreds of years.

1004
01:27:21,660 --> 01:27:23,660
Oh, is this an air bender relic?

1005
01:27:24,329 --> 01:27:25,660
I think that's just a rock.

1006
01:27:25,660 --> 01:27:27,660
But I love the enthusiasm.

1007
01:27:33,614 --> 01:27:34,889
Keep your eyes open.

1008
01:27:35,147 --> 01:27:37,274
We never know what we might discover here.

1009
01:27:46,761 --> 01:27:48,816
I thought they were extinct.

1010
01:27:55,577 --> 01:27:57,002
I can't believe it!

1011
01:27:57,763 --> 01:27:59,754
The original Air benders.

1012
01:28:07,051 --> 01:28:09,205
Aww, can I have one?

1013
01:28:21,774 --> 01:28:24,774
Retro_Ekipa with thanks to:

1014
01:28:24,799 --> 01:28:34,799
Sync and correction: FSFinker

